  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-10-26 (chat): option (a) -- add an ipc_listen deferred-crossing value. Scope: registry value; ADR-0050 section 2 table row; its own disclosure clauses worded for a local listener; re-label python asyncio.start_unix_server / loop.create_unix_server and go net.ListenUnix from net_listen to ipc_listen; regenerate docs/schema.json and docs/concept-axes.md. Before editing: enumerate consumers that branch on net_listen and report what output moves. Queued after INV-kutub, WI-sufon, WI-punod."  # 0e10
